# T5a Sky-home acceptance: summon the retained astronomy consumer, prove the
# exact Boston reference receipt, change the civil day through the semantic
# control, and capture the resulting presented timeline.
settle 30
key escape
act Open Sky reference
settle 30
assert snap panes ~ turnstone.sky
act Maximize pane
settle 10

assert text Applied: 2024-04-08 in America/New_York at Boston reference observer
assert text Fixed Earth orientation input for 2024-04-08
assert text Rise/set policies: Sun: USNO fixed refraction, upper limb, level horizon
assert text Receipt caff8371d348ba141397a8185e291c533c6ab12d4fe85f9ce3be797707ce411d
assert a11y Next day
assert text Moon: New Moon
assert text bounded TT solver interval
assert text sampled instant at TT

click role:button Next day
settle 30
assert text Applied: 2024-04-09 in America/New_York at Boston reference observer
assert text Receipt 74883b5db9fa959cccdeb69744da4a99baec5bfd55bade77426cfe6b0d9c450f
assert text Fixed Earth-orientation input remains referenced to 2024-04-08.
assert text sun: upper transit
assert text bounded TT solver interval
capture sky_home
log Sky home changed civil day and presented the corresponding Turquet receipt
